# Top-down mock-up: a shrine during a gut. Paper-lattice walls with a
# shaman-god painting and cloth strips, the altar, flags in the corners,
# candles, the blade trestle on the mat, drum and gong, the mudang dancing,
# villagers seated with their backs to us, the protagonist at the door.
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 320 224
@output ../mockups/map_gut_td.png
@preview ../previews/map_gut_td_x2.png 2
@fill D

@tiles td tiles_topdown.pix
@tiles tw tiles_topdown_walltop.pix
@tiles ns tiles_night_school.pix
@tiles cl tiles_classroom.pix
@tiles rr tiles_restroom.pix
@tiles pr tiles_props.pix
@tiles tn tiles_town_td.pix
@tiles of tiles_office_td.pix
@tiles gt tiles_gut_td.pix
@tiles gs tiles_gut.pix
@legend A tw:walltop_15
@legend B gt:hanji_face_upper
@legend C gt:hanji_face_lower
@legend D tw:walltop_13
@legend E gt:mat_td
@legend F tw:walltop_07
@legend G tw:walltop_14
@legend H gs:ribbons_0_0
